  "description": "Adds G9IntroCarousel to G9MAUIControls: a swipeable onboarding / intro carousel whose slides can be images or video, with page indicators, a skip affordance, and correct RTL paging. Ships separately because video playback requires CommunityToolkit.Maui.MediaElement and a platform media stack, which the core deliberately does not depend on.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
